            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value=" Asslam-0-Alikum!&#xa;&#xa;                                 We are passionate students of Software Engineering at the University of Gujrat. As part &#xa;of our academic journey, we had the opportunity to work on a captivating project that allowed us to apply &#xa;our knowledge and skills in practical ways.&#xa;&#xa;The project, which was developed during our 4rt semester, aimed to tackle real-world challenges and &#xa;provide innovative solutions using the principles of software engineering. With the guidance and support &#xa;of our dedicated teachers, we embarked on this exciting endeavor, eager to make a positive impact in the &#xa;field of technology.&#xa;We are deeply grateful to our professors, whose constant encouragement and expertise have been invaluable &#xa;inshaping the project&apos;s success. Their mentorship and insightful feedback have pushed us to strive for &#xa;excellence in every aspect of the project.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Ahmad Shehroz Raza, Ibrahim Muhammad&#xa;Student of Software Engineering&#xa;University of Gujrat"/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
